menu "Solana OS"

    config SOLANA_OS_SERVER_URL
        string "Badge server origin"
        default ""
        help
            Origin of the badge server (server/API.md), e.g. "https://example.org"
            or "http://192.168.1.10:3000", without a trailing slash. The console
            command "server <url>" overrides it (stored in NVS "cloud/server").
            Empty means the badge does not talk to a server until one is set.

    config SOLANA_OS_MESH_CHANNEL
        int "Default ESP-NOW mesh channel"
        range 1 13
        default 1
        help
            Channel badges park on for ESP-NOW (docs/MESH.md) until the
            server's hello says otherwise (MESH_CHANNEL on the server).

endmenu
